{"nodes": [{"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design", "label": "Design: demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decisions and findings from deploying the Forge trigger prototype to real Jira and demonstrating the flow against a stand-in receiver without connecting to integration-service."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_context_prototype_correct_but_unprovable", "label": "Context: prototype correct but unprovable outside a developer machine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every claim rested on fixtures written by the same people who wrote the code; all decisions were made against real observations, several contradicting assumptions."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_stand_in_receiver_decision", "label": "Decision: stand-in receiver instead of the real integration-service", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The client validates the response, not the responder: it needs data.summary.successIntegration and data.tickets[0].success both true; a twenty-line HTTP receiver satisfies this, so the flow is demonstrable now without depending on a service owned by another effort."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_listen_send_excluded_from_all_registry", "label": "Decision: listen and send scenarios stay out of the all registry", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "scripts/demo-local.js dispatches from an ESCENARIOS map that all iterates; listen runs until interrupted, so including it would make npm run demo -- all hang forever; they are dispatched separately in main() with a comment."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_project_filter_after_observing_real_event", "label": "Decision: write the project filter only after observing a real event", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "filter.expression assumes issue.fields.project.key; if absent the trigger would go silent with no error, indistinguishable from a broken deployment; so it was deployed unfiltered first and onError RECEIVE_AND_LOG covers expression failures."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_filter_verified_in_both_directions", "label": "Decision: verify the filter in both directions (negative half first)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Firing proves nothing about filtering and silence proves nothing about a broken trigger; the negative half runs first so it is not contaminated by traces from the positive one."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_dead_tunnel_classification_finding", "label": "Finding: dead tunnel classifies as HTTP/HTTP_503 not NETWORK/FETCH_FAILED", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The tunnel domain still resolved so the request connected, negotiated TLS and received a 503; the classification was right and the expectation wrong; the split matters operationally: could not reach it versus reached it and got a bad answer."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_failure_classification_table", "label": "Failure classification: HTTP_5xx, NETWORK/FETCH_FAILED, TIMEOUT/REQUEST_TIMEOUT, APPLICATION", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_tunnel_provider_decision", "label": "Decision: Cloudflare quick tunnel instead of localtunnel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "localtunnel dropped twice in ten minutes and cannot reclaim a subdomain, invalidating the deployed manifest; Cloudflare quick tunnels were stable and are what forge tunnel uses internally; the URL is ephemeral either way so changing it requires a variable update, redeploy and re-consent of the egress destination."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_alternatives_considered", "label": "Alternatives rejected: wait for integration-service, mock the HTTP client, declare egress permanently", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Waiting blocks a demonstrable result; a mocked client would prove the mock works; permanent egress points at an ephemeral demo receiver, so egress is added for a demonstration and reverted after."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_wire_scenario_real_socket", "label": "wire scenario: real request over a real socket", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_demo_local_escenarios_registry", "label": "ESCENARIOS registry in scripts/demo-local.js", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_finding_event_delivery_unordered", "label": "Finding: event delivery is unordered", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The update event was logged before the creation event despite happening after it; any logic assuming order will break."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_finding_ticket_produced_four_invocations", "label": "Finding: one ticket produced four invocations, not two", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without deduplication that is four sends of the same ticket."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_finding_fields_not_guaranteed", "label": "Finding: fields are not guaranteed (priorityName arrived null)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_finding_jira_does_not_deliver_description_attachments_custom_fields", "label": "Finding: Jira does not deliver description, attachments or custom fields to a trigger", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "issueFieldKeys is a reduced set; planted name, email, phone, IBAN and amount never arrived - two barriers: Jira does not send them and the allowlist would not pass them."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_finding_forge_logs_delay", "label": "Finding: forge logs serves entries with a delay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A query right after an action returned zero lines for an event that had fired, nearly producing a false diagnosis that the filter broke the trigger."}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_finding_forge_register_requires_developer_space", "label": "Finding: forge register requires a Developer Space (not said until it fails)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_finding_first_deployment_major_version", "label": "Finding: a first deployment can already be a major version (2.0.0, then 3.0.0 and 4.0.0 with egress)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design", "target": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design_stand_in_receiver_decision", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "bkt-jira-triggers/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-18-demonstrate-forge-trigger-flow/design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "bkt_jira_triggers_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_18_demonstrate_forge_trigger_flow_design", "target": "bkt_jira_triggers_o